    <h1 align="center">General information about the Cardgames</h1>
    <hr size=2>

        <p>The Cardgames are a collection of cardgames I learned (and
          liked) from various people around the world, usually during travelling
          (what could kill time better in &gt;10 hour bus/train/whatever
          rides than a good cardgame?)</p>

        <p>As I prefer to communicate with people those are multi-player
          games (but no worries, they have a computer player). If you search
          for patience (single-player) games, you are wrong here; but check
          out the excellent KDE cardgames.</p>

        <p>They are distributed under the GNU General Public License, which
